<html><head>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><p class="MsoNormal"><font color="#000000"><span style="font-weight: bolder;"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 21.6533px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;">Congratulations!</span></span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 21.6533px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 21.6533px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;"><font color="#000000">You have reached the top.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p style="font-size: medium; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 21.6533px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;"><font color="#000000">Now it’s time to descend and reflect on what you have learned during the Trail adventure.</font></span></p></body></html>